{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Angels of Park Avenue is an erotic game set on Park Avenue, where you work part-time jobs, play slots, and have sex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a young man living in an old apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His goal is to save money and buy a high-rise apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it's an adventure game format, it's easier to understand if you think of it as a visual novel where you move around a map and have conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sex scenes are of the visual novel type where you read through them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park Street has many women who will have sex with you for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By increasing four types of parameters like charm through part-time jobs, the number of women you can have sex with increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into day and night parts. During the day, you work part-time jobs to earn money. At night, you can play slots or have sex with the women on Park Street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing the high-rise apartment leads to the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play is possible even after the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving is handled by auto-save, and you can save at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties based on the protagonist's actions, allowing for relaxed play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sex occurs with mutual consent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107820?t=1763708423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107820?t=1763708423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107820/18f37e8d87d8aab1cd3c6f89eb179c7d4b6e001e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763708423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset